    "chunk_text": "S G Actuarial Consultancy wins national award for management excellence\n\nS G Actuarial Consultancy (Pvt) Limited has been honoured with a Bronze Award in the Support Services category at the National Management Excellence Awards (NMEA) 2025, organised by the Institute of Management of Sri Lanka. Notably, no Gold or Silver awards were presented in this segment, underscoring the significance of the achievement.\n\nThe award recognises outstanding operational reliability, innovation in service delivery, and stakeholder-driven performance. The NMEA scheme evaluates organisations based on comprehensive management standards rather than short-term financial results.\n\nActuaries are experts in risk management, a competency vital across all industries \u2013 not just insurance. S G Actuarial provides consultancy and training services to help organisations of any size or sector establish or enhance their risk management frameworks. The firm has expanded its reach considerably in recent years, now serving clients across five countries and delivering training to participants from 116 organisations and educational institutes in 22 countries.\n\nIn addition, the company offers introductory courses in actuarial science, designed to prepare students for employment.\n\n\u201cWe are committed to delivering quality, customised services that ensure client satisfaction \u2013 a principle reflected in the excellent feedback we receive,\u201d stated Saroja Gunatilleke, Managing Director and Actuary of the company. A Fellow of the Institute and Faculty of Actuaries UK, she was the only locally-based professional with this qualification in Sri Lanka when she attained it 13 years ago.\n\nHotel Supplier recognised at CNCI Awards 2025 for industrial excellence\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
