    "description": "Cyclone Ditwah exposes growing climate threat to Sri Lanka\u2019s endemic flora",
    "url_metadata": "http://island.lk/cyclone-ditwah-exposes-growing-climate-threat-to-sri-lankas-endemic-flora/",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "islandlk",
