    "chunk_size_bytes": 602,
    "chunk_text": "TRCSL staff donate to \u2018Rebuilding Sri Lanka\u2019 Fund\n\nThe Telecommunications Regulatory Commission of Sri Lanka (TRCSL) has donated to the \u2018Rebuilding Sri Lanka\u2019 Fund the equivalent of one day\u2019s salary of its staff together with funds allocated for employee welfare amounting to over Rs. 12.8 million.\n\nThe contribution was handed over to the Secretary to the President Dr. Nandika Sanath Kumanayake, by the TRCSL Director General Air Vice Marshal (Retd.) Bandula Herath, together with Administration Director Wing Commander (Retd.) Senaka Ruwanpathirana, and the Finance Director M.K. Jayantha."
