    "description": "Govt. expands \u2018Suraksha\u2019 student insurance scheme with additional benefits",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/business/Govt-expands-Suraksha-student-insurance-scheme-with-additional-benefits/34-786511",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
