    "chunk_text": "\u2018Singlish\u2019 mashup\n\nEven though the season here was somewhat shaken up, due to Cyclone Ditwah, Rajiv Sebastian says he couldn\u2019t just keep away from the seasonal feeling.\n\nWith his band, The Clan, Rajiv was quick to translate and record the popular Christmas hit, \u2018Rudolph The Red Nosed Reindeer,\u2019 as a \u2018Singlish\u2019 mashup (a blend of Sinhala and English lyrics).\n\nIn addition, he got the assistance of his all-time Choreographer Counterpart, Gayani Karunaratna, of Gayani Dance Studio kids, to be a part of this glamorous music video.\n\nThe song \u2018Rudolph Namathi Muwa Powwa\u2019 is now available on YouTube.\n\nRajiv also did mention that he and his band members were in no mood to celebrate their 35 years in showbiz with a concert that was schedule for 21st December.\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
