    "description": "Why good policies fail in Sri Lanka: The cost of ignoring stakeholders",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Why-good-policies-fail-in-Sri-Lanka-The-cost-of-ignoring-stakeholders/4-786532",
