    "num": "dailyftlk-7b3530d4",
    "date_str": "2026-01-06",
    "description": "Debt after Ditwah: Why Sri Lanka should be cautious",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Debt-after-Ditwah-Why-Sri-Lanka-should-be-cautious/4-786536",
