    "description": "SLT-Mobitel\u2019s post-Ditwah response leads nation\u2019s connectivity recovery",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/business/SLT-Mobitel-s-post-Ditwah-response-leads-nation-s-connectivity-recovery/34-786553",
