    "description": "Graveside memorial service to mark 17th anniversary of Lasantha\u2019s assassination On Thursday 8 January 9 a.m. at Borella Kanatte",
    "url_metadata": "https://dbsjeyaraj.com/dbsj/?p=86855",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dbsjeyarajcom",
