    "description": "Research and Development in Crisis: Structural Failures and Economic Consequences in Sri Lanka \u2013 Part I",
    "url_metadata": "http://island.lk/research-and-development-in-crisis-structural-failures-and-economic-consequences-in-sri-lanka-part-i/",
