    "description": "Republic Of Korea supports WFP\u2019s emergency cash assistance for cyclone-affected families in Sri Lanka",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/news/Republic-Of-Korea-supports-WFP-s-emergency-cash-assistance-for-cyclone-affected-families-in-Sri-Lanka/56-786589",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
