    "chunk_size_bytes": 407,
    "chunk_text": "Under the Korea-funded program, WFP\u2019s assistance is aligned with national benchmarks for the cost of a basic diet. Each household will receive cash, to cover the cost for a family of four. This support will help families cover urgent food needs as they begin to recover.\n\nWFP extends its sincere appreciation to the Government of the Republic of Korea for its steadfast support to the people of Sri Lanka."
