    "chunk_text": "Opposition targets Prime Minister with No-Confidence Motion\n\nThe Opposition yesterday initiated the signing of a No-Confidence Motion against Prime Minister and Education Minister Dr. Harini Amarasuriya. It said the No-Confidence Motion is being brought in view of the numerous errors related to subject matter and inappropriate content in the current Government\u2019s education reforms, as well as the failure to address these issues in a responsible manner. The signing took place at the Opposition Leader\u2019s Office in Parliament under the leadership of Opposition Leader Sajith Premadasa."
