    "description": "Sri Lankan-born Ray Jayawardhana appointed Caltech\u2019s 10th President",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/business/Sri-Lankan-born-Ray-Jayawardhana-appointed-Caltech-s-10th-President/34-786662",
