    "description": "WCIC canvasses the importance of safe workplaces for women free from GBVH, and the importance of ILO Convention C190",
    "url_metadata": "http://island.lk/wcic-canvasses-the-importance-of-safe-workplaces-for-women-free-from-gbvh-and-the-importance-of-ilo-convention-c190/",
    "lang": "en",
