    "md5": "b994dcc46b2ba037ba9cbdc02d380c4d",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1963,
    "chunk_text": "From applause to adventure: Ceylinco Life achievers take wing again\n\nCeylinco Life has once again transformed outstanding performance into unforgettable experiences, continuing to set the benchmark for excellence and employee recognition in Sri Lanka\u2019s life insurance sector by rewarding its highest achievers with exclusive overseas tours that blend celebration, camaraderie, and well-earned indulgence.\n\nAs 2025 came to a close, 27 top performers embarked on a vibrant three-night, four-day escape to Thailand, where they explored the grandeur of the Grand Palace and the Temple of the Emerald Buddha, enjoyed a day of thrills at Dream World, and relaxed with a magical dinner cruise on the upper deck. Meanwhile, another group of 14 sales stars experienced the best of Malaysia, from the cool heights of Genting Highlands and its outdoor theme park to scenic cable car rides, iconic visits to the Batu Caves and Petronas Twin Towers, and memorable dining experiences, all complemented by four-star hotel accommodation.\n\nThese journeys are part of Ceylinco Life\u2019s proud tradition of celebrating exceptional performance with world-class experiences. Earlier this year, top sales achievers were also rewarded with all-expenses-paid tours to Malaysia, Dubai, and Turkey, featuring immersive itineraries that showcased iconic landmarks, cultural heritage, and modern marvels. These tours not only recognise individual and team achievements but also foster strong bonds, recharge motivation, and celebrate success on a global stage, the Company said.\n\nMore than just holidays, these tours reflect Ceylinco Life\u2019s deeply embedded culture of recognising excellence, turning ambition into opportunity and achievement into experiences that inspire. For those seeking a dynamic and rewarding career in the life insurance industry, Ceylinco Life said it offers not only professional growth but also the chance to be celebrated and inspired as part of a winning team."
