    "md5": "638dd7cbdde61e7dc3ea422f875cb515",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 2002,
    "chunk_text": "Dialog and UnionPay International Join Forces to Elevate Sri Lanka\u2019s Digital Payment Landscape\n\nDialog Axiata PLC, Sri Lanka\u2019s #1 connectivity provider, proudly announced its landmark strategic partnership with UnionPay International, one of the world\u2019s largest and fastest-growing global payment networks. The agreement was signed in the presence of the Chairman of China UnionPay and UnionPay International, Mr. Dong Junfeng and the Director / Group Chief Executive of Dialog Axiata PLC, Mr. Supun Weerasinghe along with senior UnionPay International officials and leadership from Dialog Finance PLC, Sri Lanka\u2019s emerging Fintech leader.\n\nThis strategic collaboration positions Dialog Finance to enable a broader spectrum of innovative payment products, enhanced national acceptance, and access to world-class digital payment experiences for Sri Lankan consumers and merchants. These solutions will support key sectors such as e-commerce, mobility, travel, retail, and MSME operations, contributing to the national priority of expanding cashless payments and digital financial inclusion.\n\nThe partnership is strengthened by UnionPay International, one of the world\u2019s leading payment networks with a strong global presence, accepted in over 180 countries and regions. UnionPay has been expanding its footprint through collaborations in banking and payment infrastructure. These strategic partnerships continue to strengthen its role in driving innovation and expanding digital payment adoption globally.\n\n\u201cThrough this collaboration, Dialog Finance will deliver world-class payment experiences to Sri Lankan consumers and businesses while strengthening our role as a catalyst for digital financial transformation. This partnership will leverage the strengths of UnionPay International as one of the leading global payment networks and Dialog Group\u2019s leadership in connectivity and cutting-edge technology,\u201d said Supun Weerasinghe, Director / Group Chief Executive of Dialog Axiata PLC."
