    "description": "The Lee Kuan Yew Warning: Why Sri Lanka\u2019s Stagnation Is More Lethal Than New Zealand\u2019s",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.colombotelegraph.com/index.php/the-lee-kuan-yew-warning-why-sri-lankas-stagnation-is-more-lethal-than-new-zealands/",
    "lang": "en",
