    "date_str": "2026-01-12",
    "description": "Asoka Handagama, through his latest cinematic creation, \u2018Sandha  Dadayama\u201d (Moon Hunt, uses the inanimate Moon as the testifying witness to some crimes committed under the very bright moonlight",
    "url_metadata": "https://dbsjeyaraj.com/dbsj/?p=86861",
