    "chunk_text": "Ceylon Hardware Merchants Association contributes to post-Ditwah recovery\n\nThe Ceylon Hardware Merchants Association has made a financial contribution of Rs. 5 million to the Government\u2019s \u2018Rebuilding Sri Lanka\u2019 Fund, established to provide relief to communities affected by the Di\u1e6dwah cyclone.\n\nAccordingly, the relevant cheque was formally handed over to the Secretary to the President Dr. Nandika Sanath Kumanayake by The Ceylon Hardware Merchants Association Chairman T. Amirthalingam, recently at the Presidential Secretariat. The event was also attended by Vice Chairman S. Shanmuganathan, Secretary H. M. Jayaweera and member K. Pathmanathan."
