    "chunk_size_bytes": 1685,
    "chunk_text": "Metalabs wins Enterprise category award for mAudit at 2025 ICSDB Excellence Awards\n\nThe Metalabs team accepting the Silver Award in the Client Implementations (Enterprise) category for their mAudit platform at the ICSDB Excellence Awards 2025\n\nMetalabs has been honoured with the Silver Award in the \u2018Client Implementations (Enterprise) category\u2019 at the 2025 ICSDB Excellence Awards for its flagship compliance platform, mAudit.\n\nThe prestigious recognition highlights Metalabs\u2019 growing impact in the global enterprise technology landscape and its commitment to delivering enterprise-grade digital solutions that enable organisations to manage compliance, risk, and audit processes with greater confidence, efficiency, and transparency. Held as part of the ICSDB Excellence Awards 2025, the ceremony brought together leading technology providers and innovators from across the region. mAudit stood out for its innovative approach to automating audit and compliance workflows and for delivering measurable, real-world value to enterprise clients operating in complex regulatory environments.\n\nmAudit is a comprehensive compliance and audit automation platform designed to support organisations of all sizes, with a particular focus on the needs of large and complex enterprises. The platform helps businesses streamline internal controls and regulatory processes while accelerating readiness for critical global frameworks such as SOC 2, ISO 27001, GDPR, and other industry-specific standards. Through customisable workflows, intelligent risk mapping, and AI-assisted insights, the platform reduces the manual burden traditionally associated with audits and compliance management."
  },
