    "chunk_size_bytes": 1628,
    "chunk_text": "mAudit is a comprehensive compliance and audit automation platform designed to support organisations of all sizes, with a particular focus on the needs of large and complex enterprises. The platform helps businesses streamline internal controls and regulatory processes while accelerating readiness for critical global frameworks such as SOC 2, ISO 27001, GDPR, and other industry-specific standards. Through customisable workflows, intelligent risk mapping, and AI-assisted insights, the platform reduces the manual burden traditionally associated with audits and compliance management.\n\nWinning the Silver Award in the \u2018Enterprise category\u2019 represents a significant milestone for Metalabs and serves as strong industry validation of mAudit\u2019s practical impact. The recognition underscores the company\u2019s ability to deliver scalable, secure, and future-ready solutions that address the growing compliance and governance challenges faced by enterprises worldwide\n\nMetalabs noted that the award reflects the dedication and expertise of its team, as well as its continued focus on building technology that solves real business problems. The achievement further reinforces Metalabs\u2019 position as a trusted partner for organisations seeking to modernise their audit and compliance functions. As regulatory expectations and digital transformation initiatives continue to accelerate globally, Metalabs remains committed to advancing innovation in audit, risk, and governance technologies, further establishing mAudit as a solution of choice for enterprises navigating an increasingly complex and regulated business environment."
