    "chunk_size_bytes": 460,
    "chunk_text": "Book launch \u2013 Development: Not By Economics Alone\n\nThe Gamani Corea Foundation launched the monograph \u2018Development: Not By Economics Alone by Dr. Nimal Sanderatne,\u2019 Emeritus Chairperson of the Foundation, on Friday at Horton Lodge. The event was open with a welcome address by Dr. Harsha Aturupane, followed by an address by Dr. Sanderatne. The book was formally handed over to the author by Prof. Sirimevan Colombage (left) \u2013 Pic by Sameera Wijesinghe"
