    "date_str": "2026-01-13",
    "description": "Australia is not closing doors to Sri Lankans despite anti-immigration protests",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Australia-is-not-closing-doors-to-Sri-Lankans-despite-anti-immigration-protests/4-786833",
    "lang": "en",
