    "chunk_text": "Weerawansa launches  \u2018Harini Go Home\u2019 protest\n\nNational Freedom Front Leader Wimal Weerawansa yesterday launched a Satyagraha campaign in front of the Education Ministry, calling for the withdrawal of the proposed education reforms and the resignation of Prime Minister and Education Minister Dr. Harini Amarasuriya. - Pic by Shehan Gunasekara"
