    "chunk_text": "Managing Partner Rajitha Rodrigo brings a wealth of international and local expertise to the partnership. As an ACA, ACMA (UK), and CGMA member, Rajitha\u2019s career spans nearly a decade, including nearly a decade with an international audit firm in both Sri Lanka and Singapore. His experience in assurance and advisory services across various sectors provides the foundation for the firm\u2019s focus on professional stewardship and managing organisational responses to shifting political, economic, and technological landscapes.\n\nSharing her outlook on joining the leadership team, Chanie Rodrigo said: \u201cProfessional integrity and a steadfast adherence to regulatory requirements are the cornerstones of our practice. As the regulatory environment becomes increasingly sophisticated, my focus is on applying a detail-oriented, technical discipline to ensure that transparency and ethical practice remain at the core of our service delivery at W.R. Rodrigo and Partners.\u201d\n\nUnder its new structure, W.R. Rodrigo and Partners remains committed to providing assurance, tax compliance, and business advisory services with excellence. The firm continues to support a diverse pool of clients across sectors, leveraging four decades of regional acquaintance to deliver professional excellence."
