    "description": "India launches restoration work for Northern railway line in Sri Lanka under grant assistance",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/news/India-launches-restoration-work-for-Northern-railway-line-in-Sri-Lanka-under-grant-assistance/56-786887",
    "lang": "en",
